uestion-capture-workers/linear/14072287/assets/d887852fe51f08cb7296437e69b6a9632721cfd155558e6abf9a99b4f59f7ad6.png)\n\nFirst, we find the orthogonal projection of $x$ onto $\\text{Span}{a}:$ \n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\text{proj}}_{a}\\,x & =\\frac{a\\cdot x}{a\\cdot a}a \\\\  & =\\frac{6\\cdot 5+3\\cdot 1+(-3)\\cdot (-1)+6\\cdot 4}{{6}^{2}+{3}^{2}+(-3)^{2}+{6}^{2}}a \\\\  & =\\frac{30+3+3+24}{36+9+9+36}a \\\\  & =\\frac{60}{90}a \\\\  & =\\frac{2}{3}a \\\\  & =\\frac{2}{3}[\\begin{aligned}6 \\\\ 3 \\\\ -3 \\\\ 6\\end{aligned}] \\\\  & =[\\begin{aligned}4 \\\\ 2 \\\\ -2 \\\\ 4\\end{aligned}].\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\n \n\nTherefore, we get the following:  \n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}y & ={\\text{proj}}_{a}\\,x=[\\begin{aligned}4 \\\\ 2 \\\\ -2 \\\\ 4\\end{aligned}] \\\\ z & =x-{\\text{proj}}_{a}\\,x=[\\begin{aligned}5 \\\\ 1 \\\\ -1 \\\\ 4\\end{aligned}]-[\\begin{aligned}4 \\\\ 2 \\\\ -2 \\\\ 4\\end{aligned}]=[\\begin{aligned}1 \\\\ -1 \\\\ 1 \\\\ 0\\end{aligned}]\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNotice that $y\\in \\text{Span}{a}$ and $z⊥\\text{Span}{a},$ as shown in the picture above.\n\nIn conclusion, $z=[\\begin{aligned}1 \\\\ -1 \\\\ 1 \\\\ 0\\end{aligned}].$" 13194139535940 true] [17592186375448 1000 #edb/ref 17592186375449 13194139535940 true] [17592186375448 1000 #edb/ref 17592186375450 13194139535940 true] [17592186375448 1000 #edb/ref 17592186375451 13194139535940 true] [17592186375448 1000 #edb/ref 17592186375452 13194139535940 true] [17592186375448 1000 #edb/ref 17592186375453 13194139535940 true] [17592186375448 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045450 13194139535940 true] [17592186375448 1041 "selection" 13194139535940 true] [17592186375448 1104 #edb/ref 17592186375450 13194139535940 true] [17592186375448 1110 #uuid "5334d272-a1c7-5e85-8d98-e81f7bea668b" 13194139535940 true] [17592186375449 1034 "[\\begin{aligned}-1 \\\\ -1 \\\\ 1 \\\\ 0\\end{aligned}]" 13194139535940 true] [17592186375449 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535940 true] [17592186375449 1111 #uuid "e50ea77b-714b-59a